{{wikipedia|dab=pharmacy (disambiguation)|pharmacy}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|farmacie|lang=fro}} (modern French {{term|pharmacie|lang=fr}}), from {{ML.}} {{term|pharmacia|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|el}} {{term|sc=Grek|φάρμακεία|tr=pharmakeia||the use of drugs|lang=el}}, and {{term|sc=Grek|φάρμακον|tr=pharmakon||a drug, charm, enchantment}}, via {{ML.}} {{term|pharmacia|lang=la}}. Ultimately from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|sc=polytonic|φαρμακίς|tr=pharmakis||witch|lang=grc}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|En-us-pharmacy.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|pharmacies}}

# A place where [[prescription]] drugs are [[dispensed]], a [[dispensary]].
# The science of medicinal substances comprising pharmaceutics, [[pharmaceutical]] [[chemistry]], [[pharmacology]], [[phytochemistry]] and [[forensics]].
# The occupation of a [[pharmacist]].

